ValueSet: NeuroPlusSPECTTracerVS
Id: neuroplus-spect-tracer
Title: "Neuro+ SPECT Tracer ValueSet"
Description: "SPECT tracers used in Neuro+ imaging studies, coded with their entry in DICOM's radiopharmaceutical list (CID 25), as MII binds it. A tracer the list has no code for is coded by its PubChem compound ID. The label (CodeableConcept.text) is the PubChem name, see NeuroPlusTracerPubChemVS."
* ^experimental = false
* $SCT#429296007 "Ioflupane I^123^"
